{"title":"AoPS Wiki:Words of the Week","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border:1px solid #999; background: #fff; margin: .3em .3em .3em 1em; padding: 3px; float:right\"><tbody><tr><td>\n<span id=\"shortcut\"><b>Shortcut</b>:<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:WoW\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:WoW\">A:WoW</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:WOTW\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:WOTW\">A:WOTW</a></div>\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>AoPSWiki Words of the Week</b> are the \"featured\" words on <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a> for the week. Typically, every week one mathematical term and one \"other\" topic (a contest, \na summer camp, a problem-solving strategy, etc.) will be selected. \n</p><p>All AoPSWiki users are particularly encouraged to edit the pages for the Words of the Week as a collaborative effort.  \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Words_of_the_Week\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Words of the Week</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Editing_tips\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Editing tips</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#For_mathematical_topics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">For mathematical topics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#For_other_topics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">For other topics</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Words_of_the_Week\">Words of the Week</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Words_of_the_Week&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Words of the Week\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f9fbfd;border: 1px solid #98AAB1; padding:0.5em; margin-left: 5px;\">\n<center style=\"border:1px solid #98AAB1;background-color:#CADCEB;\">\n<p><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki:WotW\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki:WotW\">AoPSWiki Words of the Week</a></b><br />(<i>March 3 - March 9</i>)\n</p>\n</center>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intermediate_Value_Theorem\" title=\"Intermediate Value Theorem\">Intermediate Value Theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12\" title=\"AMC 12\">AMC 12</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<dl><dd><i>October 31 - November 6</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Platonic_solid\" title=\"Platonic solid\">Platonic solid</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MOEMS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MOEMS\">MOEMS</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>October 24 - October 30</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Community_Awards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS Community Awards\">AoPS Community Awards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pascal%27s_Triangle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pascal&#39;s Triangle\">Pascal's Triangle</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>October 17 - October 23</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Sines\" title=\"Law of Sines\">Law of Sines</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Homothety\" title=\"Homothety\">Homothety</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>October 10 - October 16</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circumcircle\" title=\"Circumcircle\">Circumcircle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8\" title=\"AMC 8\">AMC 8</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>September 12 - September 18</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partition_(combinatorics)\" title=\"Partition (combinatorics)\">Partition (combinatorics)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pick%27s_Theorem\" title=\"Pick&#39;s Theorem\">Pick's Theorem</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>September 5 - September 11</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=De_Moivre%27s_Theorem\" title=\"De Moivre&#39;s Theorem\">De Moivre's Theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Committee_forming\" title=\"Committee forming\">Committee forming</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>August 29 - September 4</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Riemann_Hypothesis\" title=\"Riemann Hypothesis\">Riemann Hypothesis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_conjugate\" title=\"Complex conjugate\">Complex conjugate</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>August 22-August 28</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simon%27s_Favorite_Factoring_Trick\" title=\"Simon&#39;s Favorite Factoring Trick\">Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Game_Theory_books\" title=\"Game Theory books\">Game Theory books</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>August 15-August 21</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Induction\" title=\"Induction\">Induction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=China_Girls_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"China Girls Math Olympiad\">China Girls Math Olympiad</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>August 8-August 14</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclid\" title=\"Euclid\">Euclid</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclidean_algorithm\" title=\"Euclidean algorithm\">Euclidean algorithm</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>August 1-August 7</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_sequence\" title=\"Geometric sequence\">Geometric sequence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Isaac_Newton\" title=\"Isaac Newton\">Isaac Newton</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>July 25-July 31</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pierre_Fermat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pierre Fermat\">Pierre Fermat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fermat%27s_Little_Theorem\" title=\"Fermat&#39;s Little Theorem\">Fermat's Little Theorem</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>July 18-July 24</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Leonhard_Euler\" title=\"Leonhard Euler\">Leonhard Euler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euler%27s_totient_function\" title=\"Euler&#39;s totient function\">Euler's totient function</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>July 11-July 17</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chinese_Remainder_Theorem\" title=\"Chinese Remainder Theorem\">Chinese Remainder Theorem</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>July 4-July 10</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Research_Science_Institute\" title=\"Research Science Institute\">Research Science Institute</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pigeonhole_Principle\" title=\"Pigeonhole Principle\">Pigeonhole Principle</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>June 27-July 3</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"International Mathematical Olympiad\">International Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_Mean-Geometric_Mean_Inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arithmetic Mean-Geometric Mean Inequality\">Arithmetic Mean-Geometric Mean Inequality</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>June 20-26</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=William_Lowell_Putnam_Mathematical_Competition\" title=\"William Lowell Putnam Mathematical Competition\">William Lowell Putnam Mathematical Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Roots_of_unity\" title=\"Roots of unity\">Roots of unity</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>June 13-19</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_Olympiad_Summer_Program\" title=\"Mathematical Olympiad Summer Program\">Mathematical Olympiad Summer Program</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Power_of_a_Point_Theorem\" title=\"Power of a Point Theorem\">Power of a Point Theorem</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>June 6-12</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle_Bisector_Theorem\" title=\"Angle Bisector Theorem\">Angle Bisector Theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ARML\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ARML\">ARML</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>May 20-27</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jordan-H%C3%B6lder_Theorem\" title=\"Jordan-Hölder Theorem\">Jordan-Hölder Theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asian_Pacific_Mathematics_Olympiad\" title=\"Asian Pacific Mathematics Olympiad\">Asian Pacific Mathematics Olympiad</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>May 4-19</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Squeeze_Play_Theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Squeeze Play Theorem\">Squeeze Play Theorem</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Squeeze_Theorem&amp;diff=26060&amp;oldid=25832\">[1]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Day_at_the_Beach\" title=\"Math Day at the Beach\">Math Day at the Beach</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Math_Day_at_the_Beach&amp;diff=26061&amp;oldid=25828\">[2]</a>)</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>April 25-May 3</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=0.999...\" title=\"0.999...\">0.999...</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=0.999...&amp;diff=25590&amp;oldid=25300\">[3]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Competition\">Seniors Pancyprian Competition</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition&amp;diff=25821&amp;oldid=25299\">[4]</a>)</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>April 15-24</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">Equation</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Equation&amp;diff=25288&amp;oldid=24799\">[5]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mu_Alpha_Theta\" title=\"Mu Alpha Theta\">Mu Alpha Theta</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Mu_Alpha_Theta&amp;diff=25290&amp;oldid=24800\">[6]</a>)</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>April 6-14</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Manifold\" title=\"Manifold\">Manifold</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Manifold&amp;diff=24792&amp;oldid=24588\">[7]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Shortlist\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO Shortlist\">IMO Shortlist</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Shortlist&amp;diff=24791&amp;oldid=24589\">[8]</a>)</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>March 28-April 5</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Economics_scholarships\" title=\"Economics scholarships\">Economics scholarships</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.