ss=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Gravity&amp;diff=23987&amp;oldid=23695\">[15]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8\" title=\"AMC 8\">AMC 8</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8&amp;diff=23988&amp;oldid=23694\">[16]</a>)</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>February 20-29</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Momentum\" title=\"Momentum\">Momentum</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Momentum&amp;diff=23690&amp;oldid=23511\">[17]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth&amp;diff=23691&amp;oldid=23515\">[18]</a>)</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>February 12-19</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parallel_Postulate\" title=\"Parallel Postulate\">Parallel Postulate</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Parallel_Postulate&amp;diff=23507&amp;oldid=23208\">[19]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10\" title=\"AMC 10\">AMC 10</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10&amp;diff=23508&amp;oldid=23209\">[20]</a>)</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>February 4-11</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics\" title=\"Mathematics\">Mathematics</a> (diff: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics&amp;diff=23202&amp;oldid=20567\">[21]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyclic_sum\" title=\"Cycli